And I've gotten much better
at catch-up doodling.

255
00:15:41,220 --> 00:15:43,200
You enjoy it?

256
00:15:43,860 --> 00:15:45,200
That's too funny.

257
00:15:46,080 --> 00:15:47,520
You there. Yes.

258
00:15:48,120 --> 00:15:49,937
Those crab pincers on your head.

259
00:15:50,020 --> 00:15:50,850
Lock them off.

260
00:15:50,933 --> 00:15:52,622
Please leave Nogomi out of this.

261
00:15:53,820 --> 00:15:55,260
Okay, I will gladly.

262
00:15:55,780 --> 00:15:57,157
Nogomi, you can't do it!

263
00:15:57,240 --> 00:15:59,380
Bronco, please let me do my share.

264
00:16:10,360 --> 00:16:11,190
Zoya!

265
00:16:12,040 --> 00:16:13,569
I can't stop the bleeding!

266
00:16:13,700 --> 00:16:15,347
I guess this is it, piglets.

267
00:16:15,800 --> 00:16:17,857
I don't want to watch
you all get slaughtered.

268
00:16:17,940 --> 00:16:20,411
I'll see you on the other side, my babies.

269
00:16:20,740 --> 00:16:22,617
Hey, what the hell are you doing?

270
00:16:22,700 --> 00:16:24,897
I'm so glad I was a part
of Oinky Doink Cafe.

271
00:16:24,980 --> 00:16:26,917
A manager can't give up that easily.

272
00:16:27,000 --> 00:16:29,117
Ronko and Nogomi are out there fighting.

273
00:16:29,200 --> 00:16:30,860
Isn't Oinky Doink your cafe?

274
00:16:33,240 --> 00:16:34,320
My cafe?

275
00:16:38,240 --> 00:16:39,300
Die, bitches!

276
00:16:39,860 --> 00:16:42,213
You're not gonna mess with my damn cafe!

277
00:16:44,240 --> 00:16:46,980
Allow me to lock off one of my pigtails.

278
00:16:47,560 --> 00:16:48,390
Ranko,

279
00:16:48,473 --> 00:16:52,577
is the pigsty special to you because this
maid here somehow got under your skin?

280
00:16:52,660 --> 00:16:53,490
What?

281
00:16:53,573 --> 00:16:55,676
Tell me, what does she have to offer?

282
00:16:56,480 --> 00:16:57,560
Answer me now.

283
00:16:59,820 --> 00:17:00,650
Everything.

284
00:17:01,340 --> 00:17:03,240
She reminds me of Miss Michio.

285
00:17:10,720 --> 00:17:11,550
Nogami!

286
00:17:11,633 --> 00:17:13,146
Power is everything in Akiba.

287
00:17:13,240 --> 00:17:15,657
A maid with no power
has no worth to anyone.

288
00:17:15,740 --> 00:17:16,860
Uzuko, please!

289
00:17:16,980 --> 00:17:20,862
If we kept listening to Miss Michio,
we would have been massacred.

290
00:17:21,160 --> 00:17:22,420
You know that now.

291
00:17:22,700 --> 00:17:25,437
That's why you've lived
your life killing maids.

292
00:17:25,520 --> 00:17:26,680
Make your choice.

293
00:17:26,880 --> 00:17:28,740
Me or her. Which one?

294
00:17:32,380 --> 00:17:33,210
No!

295
00:17:33,820 --> 00:17:34,980
No, Ronko!

296
00:17:35,320 --> 00:17:36,400
You can't do this!

297
00:17:36,600 --> 00:17:38,757
Isn't she a one and only sworn sister?

298
00:17:38,840 --> 00:17:39,800
Please, Ronko!

299
00:17:40,140 --> 00:17:42,220
Shoot me, or else she dies.

300
00:17:43,560 --> 00:17:44,740
I can't choose.

301
00:17:46,240 --> 00:17:48,337
They're both too precious and dear to me.

302
00:17:48,420 --> 00:17:50,460
Like family I never had.

303
00:17:52,820 --> 00:17:53,650
Ussuko.

304
00:17:54,500 --> 00:17:57,240
Please let them off in
exchange for my life!

305
00:17:58,520 --> 00:17:59,437
Oikidoin Cafe.

306
00:17:59,520 --> 00:18:01,960
Is my only home.

307
00:18:15,240 --> 00:18:19,280
Here you are, an old warthog,
on your knees crying.

308
00:18:20,600 --> 00:18:22,380
Please, I beg you?

309
00:18:22,600 --> 00:18:25,280
They're worth shedding tears over? Yes.

310
00:18:27,620 --> 00:18:28,900
You disappoint me.

311
00:18:29,600 --> 00:18:30,430
Forget it.

312
00:18:31,520 --> 00:18:32,350
Huh?

313
00:18:32,433 --> 00:18:33,500
What do you want from us?

314
00:18:33,620 --> 00:18:37,517
You need to squeeze out at least ten
times more of the honey money from now on.

315
00:18:37,600 --> 00:18:39,057
Then the oinky-doink is not disowned,

316
00:18:39,140 --> 00:18:42,597
and you'll let us pay off our dues
if we pay ten times more honey money?

317
00:18:42,680 --> 00:18:46,500
You want to die? No! I'm sorry!
We will! We'll squeeze it out!

318
00:18:46,860 --> 00:18:48,200
Thank you, Usuko.

319
00:18:49,060 --> 00:18:53,707
From now on, you're nothing but livestock
working your asses off for the group.

320
00:18:54,160 --> 00:18:55,260
I've had enough.

321
00:18:55,540 --> 00:18:56,775
Now get the hell out.

322
00:19:04,580 --> 00:19:05,860
Please excuse us.

323
00:19:07,220 --> 00:19:09,920
Sometime, come see my work as a maid.

324
00:19:10,740 --> 00:19:14,269
Boinky Doink Cafe is epic to
serve as a home to all masters.

325
00:19:19,460 --> 00:19:21,860
As if I would ever go to a pigsty.

326
00:19:28,340 --> 00:19:29,600
Listen up! Huh?

327
00:19:30,320 --> 00:19:32,144
I got a message from our heads!

328
00:19:32,340 --> 00:19:33,317
What are you doing?

329
00:19:33,400 --> 00:19:34,230
Shoot her!

330
00:19:34,313 --> 00:19:35,143
Now!

331
00:19:35,226 --> 00:19:36,056
She's unarmed, Chief.

332
00:19:36,139 --> 00:19:36,980
I said shoot her!

333
00:19:37,160 --> 00:19:38,500
The fighting is over!

334
00:19:42,940 --> 00:19:45,800
I got a damn hole in my pouch.

335
00:19:48,380 --> 00:19:51,100
Dude, the fighting is over. Don't shoot.

336
00:19:51,380 --> 00:19:52,498
Don't nobody shoot.

337
00:19:58,360 --> 00:19:59,420
Your hair tie.

338
00:20:01,260 --> 00:20:03,025
I'm afraid that it got ruined.

339
00:20:03,600 --> 00:20:04,430
Huh?

340
00:20:04,513 --> 00:20:05,537
Oh, that's okay.

341
00:20:05,620 --> 00:20:07,208
I can just buy another one.

342
00:20:07,780 --> 00:20:08,898
Yeah, you're right.

343
00:20:14,520 --> 00:20:18,257
Hi everyone you're all
alive we were so totally

344
00:20:18,340 --> 00:20:21,317
close to dying so what happened she let us

345
00:20:21,400 --> 00:20:23,337
off as long as we pay 10 times more honey

346
00:20:23,420 --> 00:20:25,937
money for real how are
we gonna do that we never

347
00:20:26,020 --> 00:20:28,217
even paid our regular
dues on time couldn't you

348
00:20:28,300 --> 00:20:31,317
have haggled for less
no way that whole ordeal

349
00:20:31,400 --> 00:20:34,317
was terrifying you should be grateful I'll

350
00:20:34,400 --> 00:20:39,820
work really hard everyone
I want to welcome you

351
00:20:41,820 --> 00:20:43,057
home to the pigsty.

352
00:20:43,140 --> 00:20:44,100
Super cute!

353
00:21:00,900 --> 00:21:04,724
This one's cute, but I think this
one would look good on her too.

354
00:21:04,960 --> 00:21:05,790
Would you like

355
00:21:07,780 --> 00:21:08,610
to take that?

356
00:21:08,780 --> 00:21:11,097
Yes, could you please wrap it as a gift?

357
00:21:11,180 --> 00:21:13,062
I think this one might look cute

358
00:21:26,720 --> 00:21:27,980
An ambulance, please!

359
00:21:28,360 --> 00:21:29,889
Call an ambulance, please!

360
00:21:30,020 --> 00:21:31,549
Someone call an ambulance!

361
00:21:35,980 --> 00:21:37,080
Oh, Ronco.

362
00:21:37,580 --> 00:21:40,717
I want to be a cute maid.

363
00:21:40,800 --> 00:21:42,212
Save your breath, Ronco.

364
00:21:42,300 --> 00:21:44,300
A cute little maid.

365
00:21:44,680 --> 00:21:46,974
You're already a wonderful maid, Ronco.

366
00:21:47,080 --> 00:21:48,900
A maid I really look up to.

367
00:21:49,520 --> 00:21:52,277
I want to keep doing

368
00:21:52,360 --> 00:21:56,560
this with all of you.

369
00:22:06,200 --> 00:22:07,600
Ronco...

370
00:22:36,460 --> 00:22:40,220
That's a matter of life.

371
00:22:42,280 --> 00:22:45,540
You're going to see the truth.

372
00:22:46,480 --> 00:22:48,280
You're going to see the blood.

373
00:22:50,840 --> 00:22:52,997
I'm going to cry.

374
00:22:53,080 --> 00:22:55,520
I'm going to cry.

375
00:23:05,700 --> 00:23:06,530
I'm not sure how to do it.

376
00:23:06,613 --> 00:23:07,443
I'm not sure how to do it.

377
00:23:07,526 --> 00:23:10,800
I'm not sure how to do it.
